    "Confirm whether the fixed 110 x 65 mm outline may be reduced; the block set needs far less area and the oversized board affects COST-001.",
    "Should boot-mode strapping (GPIO0/BOOT button) be added, since no GPIO0 pin appears in the pin table but it is required for flashing?",
